 2021. The recognition in 2021 of the right of use asset and corresponding lease liability were a non cash investing and financing transaction.In May 2021 the Group provided notice to terminate its property lease on its historical building in Cardiff. The lease required six months&#39; notice. Strategic ReportGovernanceFinancial Statements55Biodexa Pharmaceuticals PLC?Annual Report &amp; Accounts 2023</p>

